sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Tok as Token path
    participant Cap as Capacity
    participant Rel as Reliability
    participant Obs as Observability
    Tok->>Cap: every request costs GPU seconds, not just CPU
    Cap->>Cap: batch size, KV cache and sequence length set the ceiling
    Cap->>Rel: what happens when a region or a GPU fleet is lost?
    Rel->>Rel: cells, N+1, and a degraded mode that still answers
    Rel->>Obs: which number tells you it is broken?
    Obs->>Obs: TTFT and inter-token latency, not average request time
    Note over Tok,Obs: these ten problems are the same four questions asked about different layers
